<p>Your Defense is increased by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">5, 7, 10, 12, 15</acronym> for every adjacent visible foe, up to a maximum of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">+23, +41, +52, +61, +67</acronym> Defense.</p><p>The Defense increase per enemy and maximum Defense bonus will scale with your Cunning.</p>